<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-054-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.292087" lon="-120.927427"><name>SC26-054-B</name><cmt>SC26-054</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 70/100; not catch probability. Center 161 ft; nearby 156–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-036</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.29340732991319" lon="-120.92821774757272"/><trkpt lat="35.29286666434801" lon="-120.92823153049814"/><trkpt lat="35.29260198109737" lon="-120.9285681455095"/><trkpt lat="35.29234294452267" lon="-120.92923448110614"/><trkpt lat="35.292442466387214" lon="-120.92978172390367"/><trkpt lat="35.29190180020039" lon="-120.92979549593785"/><trkpt lat="35.291443716783604" lon="-120.92936734666863"/><trkpt lat="35.29117338372303" lon="-120.92937423385507"/><trkpt lat="35.29099880789672" lon="-120.92970854268499"/><trkpt lat="35.29063648175952" lon="-120.92960781858504"/><trkpt lat="35.2902854461957" lon="-120.93016652446605"/><trkpt lat="35.29027381181116" lon="-120.92422937390037"/><trkpt lat="35.29125559394737" lon="-120.92365452968694"/><trkpt lat="35.29224